. There will be more in the official version!</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cane - Normal attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In her human form, the vampire lady will gracefully strike her enemies with her cane weapon, dizzying them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/5cb8d55317684a159963d430dc756865.poster.avif?t=1749801967\" width=788 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/5cb8d55317684a159963d430dc756865.webm?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/5cb8d55317684a159963d430dc756865.mp4?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Staff - Break through the array with staff strike</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the Breaking-array staff to strike can accumulate a large amount of stun points for the enemy. Hitting an enemy in a stun state will knock them away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/2a48121c5c558ba04a07758de69afb3b.poster.avif?t=1749801967\" width=788 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/2a48121c5c558ba04a07758de69afb3b.webm?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/2a48121c5c558ba04a07758de69afb3b.mp4?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Staff - Force Transformation Defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the &quot;Hua Ji&quot; defense in the gap between the enemy's attacks. Once successful, it can neutralize any attack from the enemy and launch a counterattack. While sending the nearby enemies flying, if it hits other enemies, it can stun them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/09c09810845554dc316902b264e60a64.poster.avif?t=1749801967\" width=788 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/09c09810845554dc316902b264e60a64.webm?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/09c09810845554dc316902b264e60a64.mp4?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Walking stick - Execution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After hitting the enemy continuously, you can use the execution skill of the current weapon against the enemy, which has an invincible effect during the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/575085688369df039329df7edb00f36f.poster.avif?t=1749801967\" width=786 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/575085688369df039329df7edb00f36f.webm?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/575085688369df039329df7edb00f36f.mp4?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cane normal attack, Scythe normal attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While attacking with a cane, it can also smoothly switch to another scythe weapon attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/b6b57b61de59b9f8b50fa90e04d76cbf.poster.avif?t=1749801967\" width=788 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/b6b57b61de59b9f8b50fa90e04d76cbf.webm?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/b6b57b61de59b9f8b50fa90e04d76cbf.mp4?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blood Scythe - Normal Attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist in the Blood Scythe form is covered with blood-red marks all over his body, making it more agile and light. This enables the vampire lady to slash at high speed even when holding a huge scythe, easily harvesting enemies. However, a certain price has to be paid...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/bb809be9fcca2546b5e30724640b5268.poster.avif?t=1749801967\" width=788 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/bb809be9fcca2546b5e30724640b5268.webm?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/bb809be9fcca2546b5e30724640b5268.mp4?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blood sickle &lt;&lt;--&gt;&gt; Staff</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the Blood Scythe form significantly enhances the character's performance, it will consume their own health points at the cost of accumulating [Health storage]. When switching to the staff form for attack, it will use [Health storage] to restore their own health points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/09f309852175a49fb2e98fef72c5ff2a.poster.avif?t=1749801967\" width=786 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/09f309852175a49fb2e98fef72c5ff2a.webm?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/09f309852175a49fb2e98fef72c5ff2a.mp4?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both forms have their own advantages and disadvantages. We kindly ask players to use them skillfully to defuse the crisis...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill - Blood Scythe Whirlwind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Scythe Whirlwind: The character holds a scythe in both hands and twists his body to make the scythe rotate, dealing massive damage to all enemies along the longer path ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/224005cdf4b602521dd493e463b8ed7e.poster.avif?t=1749801967\" width=786 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/224005cdf4b602521dd493e463b8ed7e.webm?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/224005cdf4b602521dd493e463b8ed7e.mp4?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill - Spotting Health Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Blood curse is broken, the character swings the scythe forward while quickly retreating. If the scythe hits an enemy, it will leave a vampire mark on the enemy. When attacking other enemies, those with the mark will also be damaged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/586b42c14d9dd26de2b7ad87c52ac71c.poster.avif?t=1749801967\" width=786 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/586b42c14d9dd26de2b7ad87c52ac71c.webm?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/586b42c14d9dd26de2b7ad87c52ac71c.mp4?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blood - execution unit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After hitting the enemy continuously, you can use the execution skill of the current weapon against the enemy, which has an invincible effect during the process.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/01327230b87914fa7b4c061b61d4f6cc.poster.avif?t=1749801967\" width=786 height=409 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/01327230b87914fa7b4c061b61d4f6cc.webm?t=1749801967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong><i>It is worth mentioning that the above skills are only some of them. More skills will be released in the official version! Stay tuned!</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official QQ group: 772530189</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Black Box \ud83d\udd0d : Weaver Game Studio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Black Box game Home page \ud83d\udd0d : Bloodmaiden: Twin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bilibili \ud83d\udd0d : Weaver Game Studio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xiaohongshu \ud83d\udd0d : Weaver Game Studio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gcores \ud83d\udd0d : Weaver Game Studio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gcores game Home page \ud83d\udd0d : Bloodmaiden: Twin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contact us <a href=\"mailto:\uff1arealm_weaver@outlook.com\">\uff1arealm_weaver@outlook.com</a></strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Vampiress: Eternal Duet is a noir-style 3D side-scrolling action game. You play as Miss Vampire who switches between vampire/human form and uses blood to fight in high-speed battles. To find your sister in this conflicted world, bloodshed is the last thing to worry about...",
